Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.30,0:00:01.70,C,,0,0,0,,Otak kita sebab kita ada {\c&H00E1FF&}banyak maklumat.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.70,0:00:03.08,C,,0,0,0,,Ya betul.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.14,0:00:05.00,C,,0,0,0,,Jadi maklumat tu dia mesti bagi arahan.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.00,0:00:06.98,C,,0,0,0,,Dia {\c&H00E1FF&}tapis{\c&HFFFFFF&} dulu sebab dia celik.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.00,0:00:07.90,C,,0,0,0,,Haa {\c&H00E1FF&}celik.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.64,0:00:11.30,C,,0,0,0,,Dia {\c&H00E1FF&}tahan.{\c&HFFFFFF&} Baru dia tak rasa.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.30,0:00:14.22,C,,0,0,0,,Tapi bila buang, {\c&H00E1FF&}baru nampaklah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.22,0:00:18.00,C,,0,0,0,,Ini sebab kenapa orang buat {\c&H00E1FF&}rawatan,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.86,0:00:20.60,C,,0,0,0,,energy dia tak dapat nak {\c&H00E1FF&}flow.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.78,0:00:23.40,C,,0,0,0,,Sebab
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.52,0:00:25.60,C,,0,0,0,,terikat dalam {\c&H00E1FF&}sistem saraf
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.60,0:00:27.74,C,,0,0,0,,dia ada {\c&H00E1FF&}trauma{\c&HFFFFFF&} yang terikat.
